Installation
------------
You should already have a personal bin directory for programs you use.
If not, I encourage you to create one as a subdirectory of your home directory
To do this tpye:
    mkdir ~/bin

To install xamppcs type:

    tar xvfz xamppcs-1.0.061001.tar.gz -C ~/bin/

Using XAMPP CS
--------------
Please start xampcs as a normal user.
At the command prompt type
    xcs
to get the menu, or type
    xcs --help
for a list of command line options

